        <a href="https://pandemic.poker" target="_blank">
            <h2>Pandemic Poker (WIP)</h2>
        </a>
        <p>
            A variation of no limit heads up poker where the only options are
            raise or check. No folding, no calling. Whoever has the most money
            in the pot at the end of the betting round determines whether the
            high or low hand wins.
        </p>
        <p>
            I am Building this project to explore Cloudflare Durable Objects and
            serverless websocket capabilities. From a UI perspective, I'm trying
            to constrain myself to the aesthetic of a terminal. The vibe I am
            going for is that the worlds economy has devolved into gambling and
            you're playing this game from a CRT monitor in your bunker
            somewhere.
        </p>

