            <h2>Betswaps</h2>
        </a>
        <p>
            Betswaps is a sports and racing tipping platform that mimics the
            behaviour of a real sportsbook. All markets and odds are realtime
            and each player has a fake balance to play with. The platform
            displays your win/loss publically for all users to see and allows
            for discovery of the top sports bettors in the world.
        </p>

